  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2023-05-18",
   "text": "Access to Safe Contraception Act of 2023\n This bill prohibits states from banning any form of contraception that is approved by the Food and Drug Administration. The bill does not preempt state laws that protect the right of any entity to opt out of providing contraception due to the entity's religious or moral beliefs."
  }
